      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "German Lutheran settlers planted Hillside’s first school and Immanuel Lutheran Church at Wolf and 22nd Streets in the 1840s, marking the village’s formal start.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
